      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW DROGO (1) jumped from a low draw and boxed on well to finish third last time, beaten 1.75 lengths (22.53) behind Hara Hachi Bu at this track. Makes plenty of appeal. MOYARRA KONGK (2) jumped from a squeeze box last start but was quickly into stride and led throughout to score (22.92) at Warragul in a Grade 5 over 400m. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Deserves serious consideration again. SPRING ESPRESSO (7) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (25.22) last time in a Grade 5 at Sale. Has a strong record at this journey including three wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from five starts. Bold showing expected. BLANKET GAME (6) is worth consideration after filling a hole last start.",
